(6174318, 911831, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing image.  It makes my eyes funny, like an optical illusion where you don''t know if it''s a vase or two profiles.</td>', 'Very intriguing image.  It makes my eyes funny, like an optical illusion where you don''t know if it''s a vase or two profiles.', '2010-09-29 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174321, 911359, 96751, '<td valign="top">Graffiti in reverse looks like... graffiti!!  It almost doesn''t look like a negative until you see the sword-wielding warrior-ess...</td>', 'Graffiti in reverse looks like... graffiti!!  It almost doesn''t look like a negative until you see the sword-wielding warrior-ess...', '2010-09-29 03:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174322, 911444, 96751, '<td valign="top">Like a Blue Morpheus .  Simple but lovely.</td>', 'Like a Blue Morpheus .  Simple but lovely.', '2010-09-29 03:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174324, 911618, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is SO good, on so many levels.  Nicely balanced composition, as well as content; I love the contrast of the complex bridge structure with the void of nothingness that seems to draw our very breath.</td>', 'This is SO good, on so many levels.  Nicely balanced composition, as well as content; I love the contrast of the complex bridge structure with the void of nothingness that seems to draw our very breath.', '2010-09-29 03:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174325, 911147, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors.  Serious neon flowers.  Beautiful, and very sharp.</td>', 'Incredible colors.  Serious neon flowers.  Beautiful, and very sharp.', '2010-09-29 04:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174326, 910896, 96751, '<td valign="top">You know, I hate spiders, but as a negative, this is actually adorable.  Those eyes are like Muppet eyes.  Excellent conversion and incredible detail.</td>', 'You know, I hate spiders, but as a negative, this is actually adorable.  Those eyes are like Muppet eyes.  Excellent conversion and incredible detail.', '2010-09-29 04:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174330, 910840, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those trees are so magical.</td>', 'Those trees are so magical.', '2010-09-29 04:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174332, 911867, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  There is a wonderful movement and rhythm to this image, with lovely detail and soft complementary colors.</td>', 'Very artistic.  There is a wonderful movement and rhythm to this image, with lovely detail and soft complementary colors.', '2010-09-29 04:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174337, 910877, 96751, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how the dark, and usually less visible portion of positive images, is so clear and visible in the negative version.  And even in negative, I love motion blur.  Well done, even if you''re driving on the wrong side of the car...</td>', 'It''s amazing how the dark, and usually less visible portion of positive images, is so clear and visible in the negative version.  And even in negative, I love motion blur.  Well done, even if you''re driving on the wrong side of the car...', '2010-09-29 04:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174338, 911145, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  So textured, such depth.  And the marvelous blue hues.  LOVE IT.</td>', 'Stunning!  So textured, such depth.  And the marvelous blue hues.  LOVE IT.', '2010-09-29 04:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174339, 911163, 96751, '<td valign="top">I ALMOST entered something similar :-)</td>', 'I ALMOST entered something similar :-)', '2010-09-29 04:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174340, 911827, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just lovely.  Grapes look good in gold too, and I adore the leaves in magenta.  Great depth.</td>', 'Just lovely.  Grapes look good in gold too, and I adore the leaves in magenta.  Great depth.', '2010-09-29 04:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174342, 911885, 96751, '<td valign="top">Surreal and wonderful.  The clouds could certainly be the tree top.  Very strangely appealing color for the sky.</td>', 'Surreal and wonderful.  The clouds could certainly be the tree top.  Very strangely appealing color for the sky.', '2010-09-29 04:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174343, 911223, 96751, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a chinese drawing, or cloisonne.  Timeless and classic, and unfortunate that the two artifacts above the trees on the left could not have been cloned out.</td>', 'This almost looks like a chinese drawing, or cloisonne.  Timeless and classic, and unfortunate that the two artifacts above the trees on the left could not have been cloned out.', '2010-09-29 04:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174344, 911552, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous detail, very graceful image.</td>', 'Marvelous detail, very graceful image.', '2010-09-29 04:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6174345, 911789, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Doesn''t even look like an image.  These balls usually do very well for you.</td>', 'LOL!  Doesn''t even look like an image.  These balls usually do very well for you.', '2010-09-29 04:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
