(6174347, 911156, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous.  I can feel the wind.  There is such movement in this image, the tree is practically dancing, and the breeze is kicking up the sand.</td>', 'Marvelous.  I can feel the wind.  There is such movement in this image, the tree is practically dancing, and the breeze is kicking up the sand.', '2010-09-29 04:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
