(6174852, 911895, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is art.  It looks like a daguerreotype!  Love the composition, and the graceful arc of that leaf.  The cracks and twigs add a marvelous texture, and there is a very nostalgic mood here.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is art.  It looks like a daguerreotype!  Love the composition, and the graceful arc of that leaf.  The cracks and twigs add a marvelous texture, and there is a very nostalgic mood here.  Nice work.', '2010-09-29 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
