(6175210, 911895, 108069, '<td valign="top">I do not understand this at all, but it is a really interesting image. To be completely honest it looks like moss busting through a porcelain penis, but of course we know that could never happen. Well, maybe it is something like that. I don''t know, and since I''m not voting, I don''t have to know. Cool shot though.</td>', 'I do not understand this at all, but it is a really interesting image. To be completely honest it looks like moss busting through a porcelain penis, but of course we know that could never happen. Well, maybe it is something like that. I don''t know, and since I''m not voting, I don''t have to know. Cool shot though.', '2010-09-29 20:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6175225, 911754, 59029, '<td valign="top">...Neon burning, up above/ And I am so high on this world/ Come take a low ride with me girl/ In the tunnel of love...<br/> <br/>Sorry you took me back to when I saw Dire Straits perform this song back in Ottawa in the 1980s...Stevie Ray Vaughn was the opening act...I know this has nothing at all to do with the shot itself, but 9 for evoking such great memories :-)</td>', '...Neon burning, up above/ And I am so high on this world/ Come take a low ride with me girl/ In the tunnel of love... Sorry you took me back to when I saw Dire Straits perform this song back in Ottawa in the 1980s...Stevie Ray Vaughn was the opening act...I know this has nothing at all to do with the shot itself, but 9 for evoking such great memories :-)', '2010-09-29 20:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
