(6175755, 911784, 108069, '<td valign="top">This really stands out. Jumps out from the thumbnail and when blown up it''s just a really strong image. Colors are wonderful, and I like the organic contrast with the inorganic symmetry. That said, I wish the blinds(?) were perfectly parallel and there wasn''t a bulge where the stem is sticking through them. That''s a guess of course, as all these negative shots have me guessing as to what''s really going on. I''m not voting, just observing.</td>', 'This really stands out. Jumps out from the thumbnail and when blown up it''s just a really strong image. Colors are wonderful, and I like the organic contrast with the inorganic symmetry. That said, I wish the blinds(?) were perfectly parallel and there wasn''t a bulge where the stem is sticking through them. That''s a guess of course, as all these negative shots have me guessing as to what''s really going on. I''m not voting, just observing.', '2010-09-30 11:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
