(6177788, 911003, 12076, '<td valign="top">"Epic" comes to mind.  One of the few I would like large, on my wall.</td>', '"Epic" comes to mind.  One of the few I would like large, on my wall.', '2010-10-01 22:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177789, 911892, 12076, '<td valign="top">You can say that again!  Cool, eerie shot.</td>', 'You can say that again!  Cool, eerie shot.', '2010-10-01 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177791, 911439, 12076, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  I keep coming back for a look, and look forward to an ''explanation''.   I feel like you built that structure, then waited for a dragonfly to land just so.  But that can''t be.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is cool.  I keep coming back for a look, and look forward to an ''explanation''.   I feel like you built that structure, then waited for a dragonfly to land just so.  But that can''t be.  Nice work.', '2010-10-01 22:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177824, 911863, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is fabulous!</td>', 'This is fabulous!', '2010-10-01 23:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177825, 911274, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is great!</td>', 'This is great!', '2010-10-01 23:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6177878, 911163, 115626, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  Love the colours you''ve achieved.  Nice job.</td>', 'Awesome shot.  Love the colours you''ve achieved.  Nice job.', '2010-10-02 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178043, 911783, 106806, '<td valign="top">aside from the intereseting angle of the building this would be a rather dull snapshot if it weren''t negative. As a negative though its just super ace ... perfect met challenge</td>', 'aside from the intereseting angle of the building this would be a rather dull snapshot if it weren''t negative. As a negative though its just super ace ... perfect met challenge', '2010-10-02 08:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178103, 911552, 12076, '<td valign="top">This one I had to look at for a long time.  I just can''t figure out if I like it or not. That I find myself reflecting on that is interesting, and worth a point or two.  Hmmm.  Sometimes I just can''t get off the fence....   <br/>OK..  The image gets 4, + 2 for causing me to pause, and +1 for an introduction to Albrecht Dürer.  4+2+1=7.  Not bad!</td>', 'This one I had to look at for a long time.  I just can''t figure out if I like it or not. That I find myself reflecting on that is interesting, and worth a point or two.  Hmmm.  Sometimes I just can''t get off the fence....   OK..  The image gets 4, + 2 for causing me to pause, and +1 for an introduction to Albrecht Dürer.  4+2+1=7.  Not bad!', '2010-10-02 10:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178105, 910899, 113411, '<td valign="top">This is so original. Who, other than Martha Stewart, would have thought of this. (8 from me)</td>', 'This is so original. Who, other than Martha Stewart, would have thought of this. (8 from me)', '2010-10-02 10:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178112, 911359, 12076, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.   Took me a sec to see the sword, then it got even better.</td>', 'Great perspective.   Took me a sec to see the sword, then it got even better.', '2010-10-02 10:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178370, 910840, 104230, '<td valign="top">The lower section with the negative of the trees is especially lovely.</td>', 'The lower section with the negative of the trees is especially lovely.', '2010-10-02 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6178387, 911714, 104230, '<td valign="top">Intriguing image.  At first glance the tower felt too close to the edge, but then that feels balanced in some way by the sign on the right, which is where the eye gets led.</td>', 'Intriguing image.  At first glance the tower felt too close to the edge, but then that feels balanced in some way by the sign on the right, which is where the eye gets led.', '2010-10-02 17:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
