(6182766, 911528, 104809, '<td valign="top">I think I had a similar experience to others with this image.  I kind of didn''t like it so much at first (maybe the busy-ness of it?), but it grew on me.  I think this has helped me solidify how I''ll handle voting in the future (as I ended up doing on this challenge):  I''ll look thru everything early, then come back to the challenge entries and take my time and vote on my 2nd or 3rd viewing of the image.  I ended up giving this an 8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-06 03:43:15.</i></td>', 'I think I had a similar experience to others with this image.  I kind of didn''t like it so much at first (maybe the busy-ness of it?), but it grew on me.  I think this has helped me solidify how I''ll handle voting in the future (as I ended up doing on this challenge):  I''ll look thru everything early, then come back to the challenge entries and take my time and vote on my 2nd or 3rd viewing of the image.  I ended up giving this an 8.', '2010-10-06 04:42:36.000000', '2010-10-06 04:43:15.000000', 0),
