(6183042, 911876, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see the original on this. It''s a beautiful picture, but it doesn''t read as a negative image to me; indeed, when I take this image and invert it in Photoshop, THEN it looks negative, suggesting that THIS iteration is a positive, but it doesn''t look quite right for a positive either, so...<br/> <br/>I''d love to see the original, LOL. You have me wondering what that looks like.<br/> <br/>ETA:<br/> <br/>That''s amazing, the original looks more negative (except for the colors) than the negative does... What a weird thing :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-06 15:14:51.</i></td>', 'I''d love to see the original on this. It''s a beautiful picture, but it doesn''t read as a negative image to me; indeed, when I take this image and invert it in Photoshop, THEN it looks negative, suggesting that THIS iteration is a positive, but it doesn''t look quite right for a positive either, so... I''d love to see the original, LOL. You have me wondering what that looks like. ETA: That''s amazing, the original looks more negative (except for the colors) than the negative does... What a weird thing :-)', '2010-10-06 10:42:31.000000', '2010-10-06 16:14:51.000000', 0),
