(6185059, 911365, 30214, '<td valign="top">what a great shot Brian! congrats! <br/> <br/>by the way, it''s almost a negative of this<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=781177" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1020/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_781177.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1020/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_781177.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1020/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_781177.jpg"/></a> <br/>which incidentally also captured PH-red... isn''t that interesting?<br/> <br/></td>', 'what a great shot Brian! congrats!  by the way, it''s almost a negative of this which incidentally also captured PH-red... isn''t that interesting? ', '2010-10-07 19:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
