(6185883, 911463, 49819, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BrennanOB:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on the blue, well done. After reading your comments I clicked over to see your outtakes in non negative mode that you spoke of and was saddened to see you have no portfolio up. Nice work with the flash to adapt to the shooting conditions, very creative. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Here is the image that I took some years ago and that inspired me to shoot the one for the competition:<br/> <br/>(you have to addd wwwDOTphotosigDOTcom in front of the link) <br/> <br/>/go/photos/view;jsessionid=adPrn67fbx47U7k_kU?id=2438037<br/> <br/>And here is one outtake from the new shooting:<br/> <br/>/go/photos/view;jsessionid=adPrn67fbx47U7k_kU?id=2441339<br/> <br/>Thank you all once more :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-10 16:46:53.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by BrennanOB: Congratulations on the blue, well done. After reading your comments I clicked over to see your outtakes in non negative mode that you spoke of and was saddened to see you have no portfolio up. Nice work with the flash to adapt to the shooting conditions, very creative.   Here is the image that I took some years ago and that inspired me to shoot the one for the competition: (you have to addd wwwDOTphotosigDOTcom in front of the link)  /go/photos/view;jsessionid=adPrn67fbx47U7k_kU?id=2438037 And here is one outtake from the new shooting: /go/photos/view;jsessionid=adPrn67fbx47U7k_kU?id=2441339 Thank you all once more :)', '2010-10-08 05:38:10.000000', '2010-10-10 17:46:53.000000', 0),
(6186101, 911365, 23098, '<td valign="top">Just seeing your Negative Image entry Brian. I think that it''s wonderful the way you envisioned and produced this image. I agree with PennyStret, negative of brown is blue!</td>', 'Just seeing your Negative Image entry Brian. I think that it''s wonderful the way you envisioned and produced this image. I agree with PennyStret, negative of brown is blue!', '2010-10-08 10:32:22.000000', NULL, 0),
