(6186144, 911838, 61315, '<td valign="top">I thought this was yours! It makes a great negative - the colors look great like this too. Congrats on a top 20 finish.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-08 10:03:50.</i></td>', 'I thought this was yours! It makes a great negative - the colors look great like this too. Congrats on a top 20 finish.', '2010-10-08 11:03:15.000000', '2010-10-08 11:03:50.000000', 0),
(6186156, 910939, 61315, '<td valign="top">Great colors, interesting subject, and I like the composition. I thought this would score higher but still a nice score.</td>', 'Great colors, interesting subject, and I like the composition. I thought this would score higher but still a nice score.', '2010-10-08 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186253, 911145, 113419, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>First Impressions: <br/>To be honest?  This took my breath away!  I loved it from the very first time I saw it.<br/> <br/>Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): <br/>The composition, the lighting, the color, the focus - including the bokeh - it''s all marvelous.  And your worries over the "distractions" were for naught as what you consider distractions only add to the image.<br/> <br/>Challenge: <br/>You certainly met the challenge and did so beautifully.  AND I''m a title girl and this title is PERFECT!<br/> <br/>Artistic/Emotion: <br/>Artisticly? Stunning!  Melethia nailed it in her comment below "the blues make this rich and vibrant, and the bokeh is lovely!" <br/>Emotionally?  This is a very soothing picture and I can so totally see why you are considering hanging it.  I would if it were mine. <br/> <br/>Summary: <br/>I''m sorry to say that I have no suggestions for making this better.  I may not have been the right one to give a critique of this image but as they are randomly assigned to us I was thrilled to be able to give you my thoughts on this image.  I think posthumous and katenlow said it best with just one word....gorgeous.<br/> <br/>edited to fix the tag<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-10-08 12:36:19.</i></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  First Impressions: To be honest?  This took my breath away!  I loved it from the very first time I saw it. Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): The composition, the lighting, the color, the focus - including the bokeh - it''s all marvelous.  And your worries over the "distractions" were for naught as what you consider distractions only add to the image. Challenge: You certainly met the challenge and did so beautifully.  AND I''m a title girl and this title is PERFECT! Artistic/Emotion: Artisticly? Stunning!  Melethia nailed it in her comment below "the blues make this rich and vibrant, and the bokeh is lovely!" Emotionally?  This is a very soothing picture and I can so totally see why you are considering hanging it.  I would if it were mine.  Summary: I''m sorry to say that I have no suggestions for making this better.  I may not have been the right one to give a critique of this image but as they are randomly assigned to us I was thrilled to be able to give you my thoughts on this image.  I think posthumous and katenlow said it best with just one word....gorgeous. edited to fix the tag', '2010-10-08 13:05:30.000000', '2010-10-08 13:36:19.000000', 0),
(6186321, 911876, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro - congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'beautiful macro - congrats on the ribbon', '2010-10-08 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186327, 911617, 30214, '<td valign="top">wow, just came across this (did not click on it scanning the top 10 page since never would have thought it was yours :)). What a feat to make a negative look like a positive. And this lens is so good! Good job, and congrats on a top 10!</td>', 'wow, just came across this (did not click on it scanning the top 10 page since never would have thought it was yours :)). What a feat to make a negative look like a positive. And this lens is so good! Good job, and congrats on a top 10!', '2010-10-08 14:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6186361, 911078, 113419, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>First Impressions: <br/>WOW WHAT A COOL PHOTO!!!!!  Yes, that really was my first impression!!!  <br/> <br/>Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): <br/>I love the composition on this.  The bokeh is extremly nice.  The colors are great!  This was perfect for a negative image<br/> <br/>Challenge: <br/>definitely met the challenge<br/> <br/>Artistic/Emotion: <br/>Artisticly this is great!  I especially love how you captured this spider between the two poles.  It''s as though we are spying on it! <br/>Emotionally?  Well, it''s the perfect time of year for spider pictures ;-) what with Halloween just around the corner.  Even if your not a Halloween fan, this picture would still speak to people either because they don''t like spiders and it''s such a cool shot - or because they just think it''s a cool shot!<br/> <br/>Summary: <br/>I''m really disappointed that this didn''t score better than it did.  It''s a perfect negative shot.  I wish I could give a better critique of it.  Kinda hard when I myself gave it a 10.  I mean shouldn''t I be finding something to pick on?  For me it''s there just like it is.  It''s a wonderful, fun, kinda spooky, perfect negative image!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  First Impressions: WOW WHAT A COOL PHOTO!!!!!  Yes, that really was my first impression!!!   Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): I love the composition on this.  The bokeh is extremly nice.  The colors are great!  This was perfect for a negative image Challenge: definitely met the challenge Artistic/Emotion: Artisticly this is great!  I especially love how you captured this spider between the two poles.  It''s as though we are spying on it! Emotionally?  Well, it''s the perfect time of year for spider pictures ;-) what with Halloween just around the corner.  Even if your not a Halloween fan, this picture would still speak to people either because they don''t like spiders and it''s such a cool shot - or because they just think it''s a cool shot! Summary: I''m really disappointed that this didn''t score better than it did.  It''s a perfect negative shot.  I wish I could give a better critique of it.  Kinda hard when I myself gave it a 10.  I mean shouldn''t I be finding something to pick on?  For me it''s there just like it is.  It''s a wonderful, fun, kinda spooky, perfect negative image!', '2010-10-08 15:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
