(6186879, 911780, 113419, '<td valign="top"><br/><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>First Impressions: <br/>Pretty nice image - cool blue<br/> <br/>Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): <br/>I can see you''ve got a good dof on this; focus looks nice and sharp; as mentioned below it seems as if these zebras need their legs.  Sometimes you can get by with cutting off legs, but this is a case where they need them; perhaps because of where you cut them off....right at their bodies. <br/> <br/>Challenge: <br/>Yep!yep!  no DNMC here; you got it!<br/> <br/>Artistic/Emotion: <br/>This is a nice straight forward piece of work.  The blue in this adds to the artistic feel.<br/>Emotionally there''s not much there.<br/> <br/>Summary: <br/>Great focus, beautiful dof, nice choice for a negative image.  The thing that I see that would most improve this shot the most?  Show a little leg ;-)</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  First Impressions: Pretty nice image - cool blue Technical (Comp, lighting, color, focus): I can see you''ve got a good dof on this; focus looks nice and sharp; as mentioned below it seems as if these zebras need their legs.  Sometimes you can get by with cutting off legs, but this is a case where they need them; perhaps because of where you cut them off....right at their bodies.  Challenge: Yep!yep!  no DNMC here; you got it! Artistic/Emotion: This is a nice straight forward piece of work.  The blue in this adds to the artistic feel.Emotionally there''s not much there. Summary: Great focus, beautiful dof, nice choice for a negative image.  The thing that I see that would most improve this shot the most?  Show a little leg ;-)', '2010-10-09 08:13:22.000000', NULL, 0),
